                                            Business questions
Are stock prices generally increasing or decreasing over time?

                         Query
SELECT
EXTRACT(YEAR FROM date)yearly_stock,
ROUND(AVG(close),2)stock_price
FROM stock_data
GROUP BY EXTRACT(YEAR FROM date)
ORDER BY stock_price ASC;


Insight:
The average stock closing prices generally increased over the years, showing an overall positive market trend and long-term stock growth.


Recommendation:
The company should continue tracking long-term market trends to identify strong-performing sectors and support future investment decisions
